        "id": 3910804621,
        "type": "DiffNote",
        "body": "Fixed in 6446f4af8.\n\n- `convert_to_descend_form()` no longer saves. `complete_quest()` now saves once for every race reward (the forms, and the Lich and Vampire rewards, which had no final save at all) after `add_completed_quest()`, `clear_quest()`, and the next-stage `set_quest()`, and before `finish_pet_summon()` can run a load trigger that might extract the owner.\n- `TestDescendFormConversionSucceedsAndSurvivesReload` now gives quest 701 a next stage (702) and asserts the reloaded character has 701 in its history (`GET_NUM_QUESTS == 1`) and 702 active, alongside race, class, XP, alignment, size, feats, and DR. On the previous head that assertion fails, reproducing your `{701, 0, 0}` / `0` observation.",
