  {
    "id": "e176bcf7b504117576b1f3d349bdb5c683b6fbc8",
    "individual_note": true,
    "resolvable": false,
    "notes": [
      {
        "id": 3911025954,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Merged into master as 2d7923cac, a merge commit over the nine reviewed commits, which keep their SHAs. Master's tree is identical to the reviewed head, 6446f4af8. Work item #2 closed on merge.\n\nWhat landed:\n- **Twelve creation races (IDs 152-163):** Centaur, Githzerai, Firbolg, Githyanki, Kobold, Drider, Thri-Kreen, Minotaur, Kuo Toa, Orog, Harpy, and Stormkin, with registry data, feats, terminal and web creation, account unlocks, XP tiers, hit points, and family predicates.\n- **Five quest-only descend forms (IDs 55-59):** Death Knight, Wight, Revenant, Shadow Beast, and Phantom. They are hard-locked, and a standard quest race reward converts to them through `descend_form_conversions[]`. QEDIT and `wtool` accept their IDs.\n- **Shared mechanics:**\n  - Tauric frame, which renames leonine frame.\n  - `FEAT_PSIONIC_RESISTANCE`, and cold immunity by feat.\n  - Race-granted epic damage reduction, rebuilt on load; it was never saved before.\n  - Racial level feats keyed to the real race.\n  - One transformation-only predicate, and a NULL-safe `respec_engine()`.\n- **Help:** 17 RACE topics, PSIONIC-RESISTANCE, and Thri-Kreen in EPIC-RACES, in `help_duris_races_entries.sql` and `help.hlp`. Docs are updated, and the plan is retired into the race reference.\n- **Fixes found along the way:**\n  - Protocol v1 race summaries are cut to 140 characters so the full 45-race catalog fits the payload.\n  - `close_socket()` no longer frees an in-world character whose link drops at the quit survey or a mail or board prompt. That drop made the server spin at 100% CPU or crash.\n  - Race conversions save with their quest history, and transformation is one-way on every conversion path.\n\nRemaining follow-up work:\n- **Production:** deploying needs its own restart approval. Production help also needs a help-sync run to carry the new and changed topics, since only the development help database has them.\n- **Descend form quests:** each form needs its quest, modeled on the Vampire line (quest 34721, zone 347), before anyone can become one. The live conversion check waits for those quests.\n- **Web client art:** the twelve new `race/<slug>` media keys use the fallback image until art is added in the web client repository.\n- **Racial feat login repair:** once `RACIAL_FEAT_LOGIN_REPAIR_PLAN.md` lands, the Trelux and Lich race checks kept beside `FEAT_PSIONIC_RESISTANCE` and `FEAT_COLD_IMMUNITY` can go.\n- **Arm pricing:** #1 stays open.\n- **Flaky CI check:** one local CI run failed `test-cmake-Debug-clang-clang` in `production_profile.sh`, which dropped `-Wcast-align` from a warning tier under load; a rerun passed. The probe discards the compiler output, so its cause is unknown.",
